              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 5:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 33:46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariikini kes akakan, aitisil akwap kiswap, anyoun kamodiŋ naka Dibila, airiamar ireriakec kere; ejenunete do ebe arai eoŋ EJAKAIT.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
